WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.608 --> 00:00:01.478
(laughing)

00:00:01.478 --> 00:00:03.420
- All right Janice that's it.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.093
Janice, Janice.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.120
Hey, Janice.

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:12.020
- By the way, Chandler, I cut
you out of all my pictures

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:13.970
so if you want I have a bag,

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.363
with just your heads.

00:00:16.393 --> 00:00:17.226
(audience laughing)

00:00:17.226 --> 00:00:18.059
- That's okay.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:20.880
- Are you sure, really?

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.180
Because you can make
little puppets out of them

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:26.431
and you can use them in
your theater of cruelty.

00:00:26.431 --> 00:00:28.450
(audience laughing)

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.220
You know, one of two
things is happening here,

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:32.430
either you're seeing
somebody behind my back

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:34.970
which would make you the
biggest jerk on the planet,

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.010
or else you're pretending
that you're seeing somebody,

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:39.530
which just makes you so pathetic
I could just start crying

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:41.093
right here in the cereal aisle.

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:44.237
Happy Valentine's Day.

00:00:45.989 --> 00:00:48.040
(audience laughing)

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:51.093
You love me, Chandler Bing.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.193
- Oh no I don't.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:01.420
- You seek me out,
something deep in your soul

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:04.693
calls me out to me like a foghorn.

00:01:04.693 --> 00:01:05.526
Janice,

00:01:06.479 --> 00:01:07.312
Janice.

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:09.820
You want me.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:11.300
You need me.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:16.300
You can't live without me and you know it.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:19.553
You just don't know, you know it.

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:22.730
- Oh my God, oh my God, you have to go

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:23.563
- Why?

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:28.950
- Because Chandler still
has feelings for you.

00:01:33.095 --> 00:01:34.440
- He does?

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:35.273
- Say it again.

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:39.090
- That's right, that's right.

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:42.680
And that is why you
can't stay here tonight

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.733
and probably why you
shouldn't come to the wedding.

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:48.873
- Feeling such strong feelings.

00:01:50.219 --> 00:01:51.642
(audience laughing)

00:01:51.642 --> 00:01:53.130
- I mean I realize that his feelings

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:55.210
may never completely go away

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:57.493
but you can.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:02.200
- Oh, my God.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:06.933
I understand, I'm so sorry, I'll go.

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:13.973
Goodbye Monica.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:17.593
I wish you a lifetime
of happiness with him.

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:24.073
Chandler, you call me when
this goes in the pooper.

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:28.460
- I need you.

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:32.363
I must have you Janice Litman
Goralnik Ney Hosenstein.

00:02:33.224 --> 00:02:36.370
(audience laughing)

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:39.773
- Chandler, what are you talking about?

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:42.550
- Now that you live next door,

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:43.970
we can be together every day.

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:46.500
Sid and Monica never have to know a thing.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.850
- I don't know what to say.

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:53.940
I mean obviously we have this,

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.663
heat between us.

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:02.083
- Obviously.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:08.293
- But I love my husband and
I know you love your wife.

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:11.830
I don't think we should
get this house now.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:12.663
- Don't say that.

00:03:12.663 --> 00:03:14.340
Don't dangle the dream and take it away.

00:03:16.178 --> 00:03:17.011
(audience laughing)

00:03:17.011 --> 00:03:20.488
- Chandler one of us has got to be strong.

00:03:20.488 --> 00:03:23.910
- I understand.

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:28.910
- Although, maybe just one
last moment of weakness.

00:03:35.911 --> 00:03:38.161
(laughing)

00:03:44.009 --> 00:03:46.259
(laughing)

00:03:47.811 --> 00:03:50.144
Have any of you ever almost?

00:03:54.806 --> 00:03:56.083
- Does anybody want more coffee?

00:03:56.083 --> 00:04:00.500
- Yeah, I'll take--
- Hey there's a dog out there.

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:01.863
