Oh,

00:06:21.882 --> 00:06:22.715
my,

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:24.413
God.

00:06:26.714 --> 00:06:27.977
Oh,

00:06:27.977 --> 00:06:29.138
my,

00:06:29.138 --> 00:06:29.971
God.

00:06:32.679 --> 00:06:33.666
Oh,

00:06:33.666 --> 00:06:34.769
my,

00:06:34.769 --> 00:06:35.602
God.

00:06:37.018 --> 00:06:40.018
